---
source: umpire/dev/testing/src/runner.rs
---
prefix:
start: Model { temperature: 20, heating_on: false, beeping: false }
1: User::PressButton choice=0 -> Model { temperature: 20, heating_on: true, beeping: false }
cycle:
2: User::DepressButton choice=0 -> Model { temperature: 20, heating_on: false, beeping: false }
3: User::PressButton choice=0 -> Model { temperature: 20, heating_on: true, beeping: false }
repeat cycle
